  "privacyBody": "This app works offline and has no login. Your progress, saved words and settings stay on your phone only. We never collect your name, e-mail or location. Ads come from Google AdMob and are shown only after you accept them in the consent form; you can change your choice at any time in Settings. “Search online” sends only the word you typed to Wiktionary. For ages 13+.",
  "@privacyBody": {
    "description": "privacyBody"
  },
  "aboutBody": "A small, honest app for people living in Italy: search a word, learn ten new ones a day, and test yourself like in the driving-licence quiz. Everything works offline, with no account.",
  "@aboutBody": {
    "description": "aboutBody"
  },
  "creditsBody": "Translations and example sentences are written and checked by hand for this app. Word lists were cross-checked against open sources: Wiktionary and Wikizionario (CC BY-SA 4.0), Tatoeba example sentences (CC BY 2.0 FR) and the Open Multilingual Wordnet. Pictures use Google Noto Emoji (Apache 2.0). Italian pronunciation uses your phone's own text-to-speech.",
